  "title": "Nutty Brown Rice Salad",
  "description": "This tasty salad combines brown rice, kidney beans, crisp vegetables, and raw almonds. All are tossed with Italian dressing for a great tasting cold side dish that pairs beautifully with meats, fish, or sandwiches.",
  "authors": [
    "Jackie Wood"
  ],
